https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2020_Iowa_Derecho_(SVS31341_-_Iowa_derecho_landsat_sentinel_ndvi_2048x1152).png
Source: NASA Scientific Visualization Studio (SVS 31341), credit Marit Jentoft-Nilsen,
https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/31341 . Public domain (NASA work).
Shows Sentinel-2B NDVI (7 Aug 2020, pre-derecho), Landsat 8 NDVI (11 Aug 2020, post-derecho,
4 days after the 2020 Midwest derecho that hit Iowa on 10 Aug 2020) and the NDVI difference
between the two — directly illustrates chapter.md §1.2a's point about the ~2-week satellite
NDVI detection lag for the Jasper County, Iowa derecho damage (Gro Intelligence episode).
Tier 1 (official agency product, NASA/ESA data) acquisition for slide s08a.
